+   "source": [
+    "### Egocentric And Allocentric\n",
+    "\n",
+    "As the `tuning_distances` and `tuning_angles` are a property of the `VectorCell` one can have `diverging_manifold` for an `allocentric or egocentric` Boundary Vector Cell\n",
+    "\n",
+    "\n",
+    "Please Note: The default direction for the Vector Cell class is in +X direction (East) in allocentric co-ordinates"
+   ]
+  },
+  {
+   "cell_type": "code",
+   "execution_count": 23,
